Summary of modifications
------------------------
Changes are concentrated in evaluation correctness rather than in the simulation
itself: the grasp/event vocabulary, the subtask ladder's crediting rules, scene
settling reports, and the review dashboard. Two robot embodiments (dual-Franka and
bimanual ViperX/ALOHA) and a VLM pointing-policy connector are added.

Every change is one commit carrying its own evidence, and the full register with the
measurement behind each one is in docs/verified/changes.md. Findings that are
reported but deliberately NOT changed -- notably the authored scene interpenetration
and the object friction values -- are recorded in docs/verified/findings.md with the
reasoning.

Files added by this fork carry the NVIDIA copyright header of the upstream files they
sit beside, per the Apache-2.0 requirement to preserve attribution in derived works.
